Title: Modelos Microeconômicos de Análise da Litigância
Abstract: The goal of this work is to present a qualitative analysis of the Brazilian rules and institutes of civil and tax laws, using two microeconomic models of dispute resolution: the optimism model or differing perceptions model and the asymmetric information model.
